Subject: [PATCH] feat(platform-admin): P5.1 platform admin control-plane shell
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dedicated /platform control plane for ZONO staff, disjoint from the customer
org UI. Protected by the P5.0 platform boundary (authorizePlatform); all
cross-org reads go through the audited platform DAL — no service-role client in
any page/component. Adds the shell (RTL sidebar + operator topbar + ⌘K command
palette), an honest overview of safe count-only cross-org metrics, an
organization directory + minimal org summary, a platform audit-log view, and
capability-guarded 'בקרוב' placeholders for every remaining nav destination.

- DAL: searchOrganizationsForPlatform, getPlatformOverviewMetrics (capability-
  gated, count-only, no PII), listRecentPlatformAudit (safe columns only).
- auth: authorizePlatform() page guard + own-name display helper.
- No new production flags; no destructive actions; no Customer 360 / billing /
  impersonation (deferred to later phases).

